$ mcp.py --help
Usage: mcp.py [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  does things

COMMANDS:
  tools [--flags]  Print the tools/list reply.

FLAGS:
  -v, --version   Print mytool version and exit
  -V, --verbose   Increase log verbosity (-V=debug, -VV=trace)  [default: 0]
  --format <str>  Output format
  --quiet         Suppress non-essential output
  --no-color      Disable ANSI color output
  --no-hints      Suppress next-step hints after command output
  --offline       Disable network access
  --stream <str>  Enable diagnostic streams (comma-separated)
  --help          Show this message and exit.

$ mcp.py tools
200 {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"tools":[{"description":"Ping the server","inputSchema":{"properties":{},"type":"object"},"name":"ping"}]}}

